# E §5 step 1, a field read of a hole-day instance (tally 2.3, #247; the lead's P12, N1): `raise` (known
# 2026-03-15) raises pay, which pay_x's cash leg reads; pay_x's day is a `?`, pay_w's a window. By C-4's
# measure a later version changes the leg, so its amount read as a field is the day's hole (pay_w's too: C-4
# takes every step of the run); the fee leg, which no version changes, stays 5.00 PLN; before `raise` is
# known, or pinned, a value. Before: 120.00 PLN for both.
=== m.tally
model hd1n
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind pays: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
  leg fee: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place other: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input pay: money PLN
input fee: money PLN
input pd: date
input w: date
move pay_x: pays
  on pd
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
  leg fee from world to konto amount fee
move pay_w: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to other amount pay
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  fee = 5.00 PLN "c"
  pd = ?"which day is the pay?" "c"
  w = window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03) "c"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
  opening[other] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
version st2
  cite card
  governs 2026-04
  known 2026-04-10
  anchor konto
  stated[konto] = 700.00 PLN at 2026-04-02 end "s2"
version raise
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-03-15
  replace pay = 120.00 PLN "r"
ask amt_x: pay_x.cash.amount
ask fee_x: pay_x.fee.amount
ask amt_w: pay_w.cash.amount
ask amt_x_k: pay_x.cash.amount as known 2026-03-01
ask amt_x_p: pay_x.cash.amount with pd = 2026-03-10
ask amt_w_p: pay_w.cash.amount with w = 2026-04-02
=== expect
amt_w: ?"date within window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03) not precise enough for the day of pay_w" (w)
  unknown day: w
  cut 2026-04-20
amt_w_p: 120.00 PLN
  pinned: w = 2026-04-02
  cut 2026-04-20
amt_x: ?"which day is the pay?" (pd)
  cut 2026-04-20
amt_x_k: 100.00 PLN
  cut 2026-03-01
amt_x_p: 100.00 PLN
  pinned: pd = 2026-03-10
  cut 2026-04-20
fee_x: 5.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-20
